	"data": "VARTISTE\n\nVR app for 2D drawing, image editing, and 3D model texturing. WebXR-based.\nURL: <https://vartiste.xyz/>\nLicense: Open (check site)\nStatus: Working, accessible at vartiste.xyz\n\nWhat It Provides\n2D drawing in VR\nImage editing\n3D model texturing\nWebXR-based, runs in browser\n\nRelevance\nDemonstrates creative tooling in VR via web. The 3D model texturing pattern — painting on a 3D object's surface — could inform how users customize the appearance of thought…",
